        },
        {
          "line_no": 5,
          "page": 12,
          "start_offset": 110
        },
        {
          "line_no": 6,
          "page": 12,
          "start_offset": 166
        }
      ],
      "text": "She fixed the stone as station forty-seven. It was the first mark on her sheet that she had not made herself, and she inked it in red and drew 𝄞 beside it, a private sign, meaning: here the map begins to answer back."
    }
